      "sourceTextSha256": "9800b610246de1c0137d0d7794d6671012f63ff9fb99f3242010fcb5fa7bb75e",
      "text": "A full day in Torres del Paine, starting with a boat excursion that takes you really close to the Grey Glacier. Back at the pier, continue past Laguna Sofía, the Prat range, Lake Porteño, Cerro Mesa and Lago del Toro, then stop at the Pehoé viewpoint and walk to the 18-metre Salto Grande waterfall. Visit the viewpoints of Lake Nordenskjöld, Laguna Amarga and Lake Sarmiento, and return to the hotel in the evening.\n\nIncluded: Transfers · Full-day Torres del Paine tour with Grey Glacier navigation, entrance fees and lunch · Breakfast",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_aligned",
        "fileId": "1nHB-5Xavr6R_fNkR408Fk_Ch8G6c2l00",
